::name_set1
/* Gradient from black to white after some scrolling, then the below.*/

<<type 40ms>>
\> You're finally here.

\> This story is about you. What should we call you?


\>> I think... I think you can call me <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_confirm">>

<</type>>

::name_confirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to false>>

<<type 40ms>>
\> $name. A lot is going to happen, $name.

\> If it's any consolation, it's all in your hands.


\>> [[[Wait. I think I might be someone else?|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[.. What do you mean? What is this?|question2]]]

<</type>>

::name_reselect

<<type 40ms>>

\> It's so easy to forget, isn't it? Who are you, then?

\>> <<textbox "$name" "???" "name_reconfirm">> That's it.


<</type>>

::name_reconfirm

/* Variable below to smooth the first sentence from second question? */
<<set $name_resel to true>>

<<type 40ms>>
\> You know this for sure, $name?

\> After all, you should be certain.


\>> [[[.. One more time.|name_reselect]]]

\>> [[[Yes. I do.|question2]]]

<</type>>

::question2

<<type 40ms>>

<<if $name_resel is true>>

\> Wonderful. We need to know - what enraptures you?
<<else>>

\> You'll see in due time. For now, we must know - what enraptures you?
<</if>>
